    (Name:'orient'; Kind:'string'; DefVal:'''LR'''; UiKind:'enum'; SinceVer:''; EnumIdx:58; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'The direction of the orthogonal layout in the tree diagram. That means this configuration takes effect only if layout = ''orthogonal''. The corresponding directions are from left to right, from right to'; DescZh:'树图中 正交布局 的方向，也就是说只有在 layout = ''orthogonal'' 的时候，该配置项才生效。对应有 水平 方向的 从左到右，从右到左；以及垂直方向的 从上到下，从下到上。取值分别为 ''LR'' , ''RL'', ''TB'', ''BT''。注意，之前的配置项值 ''horizontal'' 等同于 ''LR''， ''vertical'' 等同于 ''TB''。'),
    (Name:'symbolSize'; Kind:'number|Array|Function'; DefVal:'7'; UiKind:'number'; SinceVer:''; EnumIdx:-1; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'symbol size. It can be set to single numbers like 10, or use an array to represent width and height. For example, [20, 10] means symbol width is 20, and height is10.'; DescZh:'标记的大小，可以设置成诸如 10 这样单一的数字，也可以用数组分开表示宽和高，例如 [20, 10] 表示标记宽为20，高为10。'),
    (Name:'edgeShape'; Kind:'string'; DefVal:'''curve'''; UiKind:'enum'; SinceVer:'4.7.0'; EnumIdx:59; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'Since v4.7.0'; DescZh:'从 v4.7.0 开始支持'),
    (Name:'edgeForkPosition'; Kind:'string'; DefVal:'''50%'''; UiKind:'percent'; SinceVer:''; EnumIdx:-1; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'This is the position where the polyline branches in the subtree when the shape of the edge is a polyline in the orthogonal layout. The position here refers to the percentage of the distance between th'; DescZh:'正交布局下当边的形状是折线时，子树中折线段分叉的位置。这里的位置指的是分叉点与子树父节点的距离占整个子树高度的百分比。默认取值是 ''50%''，可以是 [''0'', ''100%''] 之间。'),
    (Name:'expandAndCollapse'; Kind:'boolean'; DefVal:'true'; UiKind:'boolean'; SinceVer:''; EnumIdx:-1; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'Subtree collapses and expands interaction, default true. As the drawing area is limited, and usually the nodes of a tree may be more, so there will be hidden between the nodes. In order to avoid this '; DescZh:'子树折叠和展开的交互，默认打开 。由于绘图区域是有限的，而通常一个树图的节点可能会比较多，这样就会出现节点之间相互遮盖的问题。为了避免这一问题，可以将暂时无关的子树折叠收起，等到需要时再将其展开。如上面径向布局树图示例，节点中心用蓝色填充的就是折叠收起的子树，可以点击将其展开。'),
    (Name:'initialTreeDepth'; Kind:'number'; DefVal:'2'; UiKind:'number'; SinceVer:''; EnumIdx:-1; FirstChild:6266; ChildCount:0; DescEn:'The initial level (depth) of the tree. The root node is the 0th layer, then the first layer, the second layer, ... , until the leaf node. This configuration item is primarily used in conjunction with '; DescZh:'树图初始展开的层级（深度）。根节点是第 0 层，然后是第 1 层、第 2 层，... ，直到叶子节点。该配置项主要和 折叠展开 交互一起使用，目的还是为了防止一次展示过多节点，节点之间发生遮盖。如果设置为 -1 或者 null 或者 undefined，所有节点都将展开。'),
